msgid "OneDrive"
msgstr "OneDrive"

#: ui/app.slint:2266
msgid ""
"A personal Microsoft account (Outlook, Hotmail, Live) or a work or school "
"account."
msgstr "Un account Microsoft personale (Outlook, Hotmail, Live) o un account aziendale o scolastico."

#: ui/app.slint:2273
msgid "SharePoint library"
